WebInject2026 — third-party attributions
========================================

Attack payloads
  Portions of the attack payload set derive from PayloadsAllTheThings
  (https://github.com/swisskyrepo/PayloadsAllTheThings), licensed under the MIT
  License. A curated seed subset is embedded in src/payloads.py so the corpus is
  reproducible without downloading that repository; if the repository is placed
  under data/patt/, the build widens each family from it.

Target applications (referenced by name only; not redistributed)
  DVWA (Damn Vulnerable Web Application) — GPL-3.0
  OWASP Juice Shop — MIT
  bWAPP (buggy Web Application) — GPL

Comparison datasets (redistributed under data/ for research comparison)
  CSIC 2010 HTTP dataset — Spanish National Research Council (CSIC)
  ECML/PKDD 2007 Discovery Challenge dataset
  These files (data/csic_parsed.csv, data/ecml_parsed.csv) are reparsed to a
  common schema and remain subject to their original terms.
